  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "シンプルな　赤いボールの　ピック最初に　ほのおタイプの　ポケモンを選んだ　トレーナーが　よく使っている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "심플한 빨간색 볼 모양 픽. 첫 포켓몬으로 불꽃타입을 선택한 트레이너가 자주 사용한다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "簡約的紅色珠珠小籤。最初選擇了火屬性寶可夢的訓練家經常使用。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une pique ornée d’une simple Poké Ball rouge. Elle est souvent utilisée par les Dresseurs ayant choisi un Pokémon de type Feu comme partenaire de départ.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein schlichter Pikser im Design eines roten Pokéballs. Wird häufig von Trainern verwendet, die als ihr erstes Pokémon eines vom Typ Feuer wählten.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un palillo con un sencillo diseño de una Poké Ball roja. Especialmente popular entre aquellos que eligieron a un Pokémon de tipo Fuego como primer compañero.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Stecchino a forma di una semplice Poké Ball rossa. Viene spesso usato da Allenatori che scelgono come primo compagno d’avventure un Pokémon di tipo Fuoco.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A sandwich pick with a simple red Poké Ball design. Often used by Trainers who picked a Fire-type Pokémon for their first partner.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
